          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఎడ్లబండి (eḍlabaṇḍi) is a Telugu compound: ఎడ్ల, from ఎద్దు, \"an ox\", plural ఎడ్లు, native Dravidian (DEDR 815), and బండి, \"a cart\", which DEDR lists among its Indo-Aryan loans (DEDR App. 50)."
            }
          ]
        },
